 ssible\, and we will help you resell your workshop spot to the group. We w
 ill reimburse you for the ticket price if we can resell the ticket. Howeve
 r\, if we cannot resell the spot\, you may transfer it to someone else to 
 attend in your place\, but unfortunately\, no refund will be provided.\nWe
  look forward to welcoming you to this inspiring workshop and helping you 
 enhance your photography skills
